{"tmpaudio/ps19/c01.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "There's", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.542}, {"text": "a", "start": 0.542, "end": 0.576}, {"text": "yellow", "start": 0.576, "end": 0.797}, {"text": "tag", "start": 0.797, "end": 1.085}, {"text": "on", "start": 1.085, "end": 1.492}, {"text": "a", "start": 1.492, "end": 1.627}, {"text": "machine", "start": 1.627, "end": 1.864}, {"text": "at", "start": 1.864, "end": 2.085}, {"text": "work", "start": 2.085, "end": 2.339}, {"text": "that", "start": 2.339, "end": 2.983}, {"text": "says", "start": 2.983, "end": 3.203}, {"text": "one", "start": 3.203, "end": 3.61}, {"text": "word,", "start": 3.61, "end": 4.085}, {"text": "warning.", "start": 4.322, "end": 5.441}], "text": "There's a yellow tag on a machine at work that says one word, warning."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c02.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "Whoever", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.593}, {"text": "wrote", "start": 0.593, "end": 0.831}, {"text": "that", "start": 0.831, "end": 1.051}, {"text": "tag", "start": 1.051, "end": 1.373}, {"text": "wasn't", "start": 1.373, "end": 1.864}, {"text": "being", "start": 1.864, "end": 2.068}, {"text": "mean.", "start": 2.068, "end": 2.407}, {"text": "He", "start": 3.661, "end": 4.153}, {"text": "was", "start": 4.153, "end": 4.322}, {"text": "trying", "start": 4.322, "end": 4.576}, {"text": "to", "start": 4.576, "end": 4.814}, {"text": "keep", "start": 4.814, "end": 5.017}, {"text": "my", "start": 5.017, "end": 5.203}, {"text": "hand.", "start": 5.203, "end": 5.525}], "text": "Whoever wrote that tag wasn't being mean. He was trying to keep my hand."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c03.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "Moreover,", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.712}, {"text": "by", "start": 0.712, "end": 1.119}, {"text": "them", "start": 1.119, "end": 1.559}, {"text": "is", "start": 1.559, "end": 3.22}, {"text": "thy", "start": 3.22, "end": 3.475}, {"text": "servant", "start": 3.475, "end": 4.136}, {"text": "warned.", "start": 4.136, "end": 5.373}], "text": "Moreover, by them is thy servant warned."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c04.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "and", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.525}, {"text": "in", "start": 0.525, "end": 0.661}, {"text": "keeping", "start": 0.661, "end": 1.102}, {"text": "of", "start": 1.102, "end": 1.508}, {"text": "them", "start": 1.508, "end": 1.797}, {"text": "there", "start": 1.797, "end": 3.085}, {"text": "is", "start": 3.085, "end": 3.441}, {"text": "great", "start": 3.441, "end": 4.542}, {"text": "reward.", "start": 4.542, "end": 5.407}], "text": "and in keeping of them there is great reward."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c05.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "That's", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.593}, {"text": "a", "start": 0.593, "end": 0.661}, {"text": "Psalm", "start": 0.661, "end": 1.051}, {"text": "19", "start": 1.051, "end": 2.847}, {"text": "verse", "start": 2.847, "end": 5.22}, {"text": "11.", "start": 5.22, "end": 5.542}], "text": "That's a Psalm 19 verse 11."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c06.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "God's", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.644}, {"text": "word", "start": 0.644, "end": 0.797}, {"text": "does", "start": 0.797, "end": 1.085}, {"text": "two", "start": 1.085, "end": 1.305}, {"text": "things,", "start": 1.305, "end": 1.695}, {"text": "David", "start": 1.763, "end": 2.0}, {"text": "says.", "start": 2.0, "end": 2.271}, {"text": "It", "start": 2.797, "end": 3.373}, {"text": "warns", "start": 3.373, "end": 3.898}, {"text": "you", "start": 3.898, "end": 3.983}, {"text": "and", "start": 3.983, "end": 4.78}, {"text": "it", "start": 4.78, "end": 5.068}, {"text": "rewards", "start": 5.068, "end": 5.39}, {"text": "you.", "start": 5.39, "end": 5.78}], "text": "God's word does two things, David says. It warns you and it rewards you."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c07.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "A", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.458}, {"text": "warning", "start": 0.458, "end": 0.763}, {"text": "isn't", "start": 0.763, "end": 1.373}, {"text": "God", "start": 1.373, "end": 1.576}, {"text": "being", "start": 1.576, "end": 1.881}, {"text": "hard", "start": 1.881, "end": 2.169}, {"text": "on", "start": 2.169, "end": 2.356}, {"text": "you.", "start": 2.356, "end": 2.542}, {"text": "It's", "start": 3.136, "end": 3.729}, {"text": "God", "start": 3.729, "end": 4.068}, {"text": "keeping", "start": 4.068, "end": 4.763}, {"text": "your", "start": 4.763, "end": 5.034}, {"text": "hand", "start": 5.034, "end": 5.254}, {"text": "whole.", "start": 5.254, "end": 5.576}], "text": "A warning isn't God being hard on you. It's God keeping your hand whole."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c08.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "I've", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.525}, {"text": "ignored", "start": 0.525, "end": 0.814}, {"text": "some", "start": 0.814, "end": 1.017}, {"text": "warnings", "start": 1.017, "end": 1.305}, {"text": "in", "start": 1.305, "end": 1.508}, {"text": "my", "start": 1.508, "end": 1.61}, {"text": "life.", "start": 1.61, "end": 1.864}, {"text": "Every", "start": 2.966, "end": 3.407}, {"text": "one", "start": 3.407, "end": 3.627}, {"text": "costs", "start": 3.627, "end": 4.593}, {"text": "more", "start": 4.593, "end": 4.915}, {"text": "than", "start": 4.915, "end": 5.119}, {"text": "reading", "start": 5.119, "end": 5.339}, {"text": "it", "start": 5.339, "end": 5.492}, {"text": "would", "start": 5.492, "end": 5.61}, {"text": "have.", "start": 5.61, "end": 5.831}], "text": "I've ignored some warnings in my life. Every one costs more than reading it would have."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c09.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "The", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.475}, {"text": "reward", "start": 0.475, "end": 0.78}, {"text": "isn't", "start": 0.78, "end": 1.288}, {"text": "only", "start": 1.288, "end": 1.441}, {"text": "heaven", "start": 1.441, "end": 1.763}, {"text": "later,", "start": 1.763, "end": 2.051}, {"text": "it's", "start": 2.153, "end": 3.153}, {"text": "a", "start": 3.153, "end": 3.203}, {"text": "clear", "start": 3.203, "end": 3.475}, {"text": "head", "start": 3.475, "end": 3.712}, {"text": "tonight,", "start": 3.712, "end": 4.0}, {"text": "a", "start": 4.203, "end": 4.949}, {"text": "house", "start": 4.949, "end": 5.254}, {"text": "still", "start": 5.254, "end": 5.508}, {"text": "standing.", "start": 5.508, "end": 5.898}], "text": "The reward isn't only heaven later, it's a clear head tonight, a house still standing."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c10.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "Today,", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.576}, {"text": "read", "start": 0.763, "end": 1.508}, {"text": "the", "start": 1.508, "end": 1.644}, {"text": "warning", "start": 1.644, "end": 1.915}, {"text": "before", "start": 1.915, "end": 2.22}, {"text": "you", "start": 2.22, "end": 2.424}, {"text": "touch", "start": 2.424, "end": 2.627}, {"text": "the", "start": 2.627, "end": 2.78}, {"text": "machine.", "start": 2.78, "end": 3.034}, {"text": "One", "start": 3.746, "end": 4.288}, {"text": "chapter", "start": 4.288, "end": 4.593}, {"text": "before", "start": 4.593, "end": 5.22}, {"text": "one", "start": 5.22, "end": 5.576}, {"text": "app.", "start": 5.576, "end": 5.847}], "text": "Today, read the warning before you touch the machine. One chapter before one app."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c11.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "Let's", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.593}, {"text": "pray.", "start": 0.593, "end": 0.746}, {"text": "Father,", "start": 2.559, "end": 2.932}, {"text": "thank", "start": 3.0, "end": 3.169}, {"text": "you", "start": 3.169, "end": 3.339}, {"text": "for", "start": 3.339, "end": 3.492}, {"text": "warning", "start": 3.492, "end": 3.763}, {"text": "us", "start": 3.763, "end": 3.983}, {"text": "before", "start": 3.983, "end": 4.22}, {"text": "the", "start": 4.22, "end": 4.407}, {"text": "trouble,", "start": 4.407, "end": 4.678}, {"text": "not", "start": 4.797, "end": 5.322}, {"text": "after.", "start": 5.322, "end": 5.695}], "text": "Let's pray. Father, thank you for warning us before the trouble, not after."}, "tmpaudio/ps19/c12.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "Open", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.61}, {"text": "our", "start": 0.61, "end": 0.847}, {"text": "eyes", "start": 0.847, "end": 1.288}, {"text": "to", "